  "sourceTitle": "Egg Sandwich Spread",
  "sourceText": "Egg Sandwich Spread\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 17, 2009 - 12:19am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n5 hard cooked eggs, chopped fine\n1 cup stuffed olives, chopped\n1 cup chopped pecans\n1/4 cup minced onion\n1 cup mayonnaise\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix ingredients thoroughly. Spread on rye, French or white bread. Makes 3 1/2 cups spread and approximately 72 party sandwiches. May add 2 extra eggs if needed.",
